17592186045417] [17592186403370 #edb/ref 1074 "Remember that the equation of a sphere centered at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ with radius $r>0$ is given by\n\n$$\n(x-{x}_{0})^{2}+(y-{y}_{0})^{2}+(z-{z}_{0})^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nWe can write our equation as\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+(y-(-5))^{2}+{z}^{2}=(\\sqrt{10})^{2},\n$$\n\nwhich gives us the center at the point point $C(0,-5,0)$ and the radius $r=\\sqrt{10}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403372 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403373 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403374 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403375 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403376 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186403376 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403371 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "8139d71c-70dc-59f4-9860-d5ad6c1654cc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403372 #edb/ref 1080 "$r=\\sqrt{10}$ and $C(0,5,0)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403372 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403372 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "31387237-56d6-52c2-9715-e7aa1debedf0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403373 #edb/ref 1080 "$r=10$ and $C(0,0,-5)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403373 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403373 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "634baf73-26e0-5f65-be9f-a93d12600043" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403374 #edb/ref 1080 "$r=10$ and $C(0,5,0)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403374 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403374 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7979aab2-f218-59e3-9e9f-303812b87e70" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403375 #edb/ref 1080 "$r=\\sqrt{10}$ and $C(-5,0,0)$" #ed